  "description": "JSON-driven queries for Entity Framework Core. A powerful, versatile library for dynamically composing complex filter, sort, paginate, group, aggregate, and set-operation (Union / Intersect / Except) expressions — all driven by simple JSON objects from any front-end or API consumer. Three composable shapes (Filter / Segment / Summary), seventeen IQueryable extension methods, nested navigation through references and collections with auto-wrapped .Any() lambdas, heterogeneous Condition.Values with type-safe coercion, and a thread-safe reflection cache with six tuned presets (FIFO / LRU / LFU). Targets .NET 6+. Free Forever. Full reference, JSON cookbook, and tuning guide at https://doc.dynamicwhere.com.",
